From da660541d8e90c48ee6a1297b95b48e6081ec803 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:19:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 47/47] Restore the cache-control tables after a GPU hang reset

After recovery the GPU ran 20-40x slower than before the first hang with
unchanged clocks. Save the global MOCS (0x4000..) and L3 cache control
(0xB020..) tables with the render registers and rewrite entries that the
reset changed. Widen the recovery register copies to the MOCS, chicken,
power-gating, LNCF and half-slice ranges.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md              |  2 +-
 README_ja.md           |  2 +-
 WhateverXe/kern_xe.cpp | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

